# Conserved vocabulary module: fleet-family-registry (fr:), absorbed 2026-09-30.
# Declarations from packs/fleet-family-registry/ontology.ttl v0.1.0; equivalence axioms
# map every term onto the canonical af: namespace. fr:Binding facts carry the projection
# property set (consumer/family/targetRepo/targetPath/authority), so fr:Binding maps onto
# af:Projection. fr:name (family display name) and fr:extension (file extension) map onto
# the af: terms added for this absorption. fr: used its own metaclasses (fr:Class,
# fr:Property) where the canonical vocabulary uses rdfs:Class / rdf:Property — recorded
# as metaclass mappings, not domain terms.
@prefix fr: <https://ggen.dev/fleet-family-registry#> .
@prefix af: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/adapter-family#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

fr:Family a fr:Class ; owl:equivalentClass af:AdapterFamily .
fr:Consumer a fr:Class ; owl:equivalentClass af:Consumer .
fr:Binding a fr:Class ; owl:equivalentClass af:Projection .
fr:Class rdfs:subClassOf rdfs:Class .
fr:Property rdfs:subClassOf rdf:Property .
fr:name a fr:Property ; owl:equivalentProperty af:name .
fr:templateKey a fr:Property ; owl:equivalentProperty af:templateKey .
fr:extension a fr:Property ; owl:equivalentProperty af:fileExtension .
fr:consumer a fr:Property ; owl:equivalentProperty af:consumer .
fr:family a fr:Property ; owl:equivalentProperty af:family .
fr:targetRepo a fr:Property ; owl:equivalentProperty af:targetRepo .
fr:targetPath a fr:Property ; owl:equivalentProperty af:targetPath .
fr:authority a fr:Property ; owl:equivalentProperty af:authority .
